#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:3
msgid "RobotMode"
msgstr "RobotMode"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:7
msgid "Role of the class"
msgstr "Rôle de la classe"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:9
msgid "``RobotMode`` is a Java enumeration."
msgstr "``RobotMode`` est une énumération Java."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:11
msgid ""
"It defines the different possible states of the robot and provides a "
"clean representation of the state machine used by ``TERBot``."
msgstr ""
"Elle définit les différents états possibles du robot et permet de "
"représenter proprement la machine à états utilisée par ``TERBot``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:16
msgid "Responsibilities"
msgstr "Responsabilités"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:18
msgid "List the possible robot states."
msgstr "Lister les états possibles du robot."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:19
msgid "Make the state machine easier to understand."
msgstr "Rendre la machine à états plus claire."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:20
msgid "Replace string values with controlled values."
msgstr "Remplacer les chaînes de caractères par des valeurs contrôlées."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:21
msgid "Improve code readability."
msgstr "Faciliter la lecture du code."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:25
msgid "Encapsulation"
msgstr "Encapsulation"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:27
msgid "The enumeration does not contain any internal attributes."
msgstr "L'énumération ne possède pas d'attribut interne."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:29
msgid ""
"Its sole purpose is to group together the possible values of the robot "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"Elle sert uniquement à regrouper les valeurs possibles du mode du robot."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:34
msgid "Relations with other classes"
msgstr "Relations avec les autres classes"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:36
msgid "``RobotMode`` is used by ``TERBot`` through the ``mode`` attribute."
msgstr ""
"``RobotMode`` est utilisée par ``TERBot`` via l'attribut ``mode``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:40
msgid "Values"
msgstr "Valeurs"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:42
msgid "``SEARCH`` : searching for a puck."
msgstr "``SEARCH`` : recherche d'un palet."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:44
msgid "``TOUCH_AVOID`` : avoidance behavior after contact with an obstacle."
msgstr "``TOUCH_AVOID`` : évitement après contact avec un obstacle."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:46
msgid "``APPROACH_PUCK`` : approaching a targeted puck."
msgstr "``APPROACH_PUCK`` : approche d'un palet ciblé."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:48
msgid "``LOWER_ARM`` : lowering the arm."
msgstr "``LOWER_ARM`` : abaissement du bras."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:50
msgid "``CLOSE_GRIPPER`` : closing the gripper."
msgstr "``CLOSE_GRIPPER`` : fermeture de la pince."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:52
msgid "``LIFT_ARM`` : raising the arm after grasping."
msgstr "``LIFT_ARM`` : levée du bras après saisie."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:54
msgid "``GO_TO_DROP_ZONE`` : moving toward the drop zone."
msgstr "``GO_TO_DROP_ZONE`` : déplacement vers la zone de dépôt."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:56
msgid "``DROP_PUCK`` : dropping the puck."
msgstr "``DROP_PUCK`` : dépôt du palet."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:58
msgid "``LIFT_ARM_AFTER_DROP`` : raising the arm after dropping the puck."
msgstr "``LIFT_ARM_AFTER_DROP`` : remontée du bras après dépôt."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/robot_mode.rst:60
msgid ""
"``BACK_AND_TURN_AFTER_DROP`` : reversing and turning after dropping the "
"puck."
msgstr ""
"``BACK_AND_TURN_AFTER_DROP`` : recul et rotation après dépôt du palet."